# Docs sync

When a change affects product behavior, content structure, privacy, accessibility claims, setup, or contribution workflow — **before finishing** — update every affected doc:

1. `README.md`
2. `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `PRIVACY.md`, `SECURITY.md`, `LICENSE` notices when relevant
3. In-app legal/content pages (`app/privacy`, `app/accessibilita`, `lib/site.ts`, `lib/seo.ts`) when the public site copy must match

Do not leave docs describing old behavior. Prefer short, accurate updates over new files.
